YQKMV2DZYobAupMeQe4p6Y_LHhJUlTdTsA&oe=6AFDC2E8"}, {"file_name": "0685.png", "id": "28785379597737113", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491828038_28785379624403777_4813154763316492450_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zsrPbKhVUT8Q7kNvwEdhsnZ&_nc_oc=AdpNs9zfHY23Juz-Ov0UqP8OYT4bovqwP7XzMv-3ns-nU69shd6W4Y5MsrNJNLXQ7x0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQEMlmy6EBn_V7mNZ-UqLX4gagN3uWEz0aDjh4-1M3b2w&oe=6AFDBE5F"}, {"file_name": "0700.png", "id": "28719832201005628", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491825563_28719832224338959_5594165781787087792_n.png?_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-ierqIv1EzAQ7kNvwF7uKz-&_nc_oc=AdpUJ_hhVB74EVdDc7e5ZK8ctj3F-Kcu9PHsU_JgAC1_Ycx8beeoYMD-ZCl4lOblQfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSJNAVa4HPmFynmak_xF3dFP9_bdp29FtmvmsBdgc8OSQ&oe=6AFDB6E2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Arrowfall", "keywords": ["archery", "bow", "roguelite", "synthwave", "wave"], "long_description": "**The sky has torn open above Neon Meridian.** The Eclipse, a living black hole, is feeding on suns, and its swarm pours through the rift: pouncing swarmers, charging beasts, hulking brutes, splitters, shield-bearing phalanxes, shamans that harden the crowd, living bombs, burrowers and rail skaters. The Arrowkeepers fell one by one. **You are the last.**\n\n- Your ground is **the Bowl**, a neon rooftop skate arena. Charge the Nexus inside its dome, survive the surge it calls, and go again. Every level is harder.\n\n- **Move like nothing else in VR.** Sweep your arms to skate, launch off the lip, chain air jumps and dives.\n\n- **A real bow, in mid-air.** Draw, aim, release. Arrows ricochet off everything and curve toward their targets. Slow time to thread the impossible shot.\n\n- **Throw black holes.** Drag the horde into a single knot, then shoot into it for a devastating blast.\n\n- **Builds that break the screen.** Burning tips, homing rockets, chain lightning, echo shots, meteor storms. Stack them, chain kills into combos, open legendary chests.\n\n- **Elites and bosses.** Champions with blazing, glacial and mending auras, Wardens and Overlords, and at the end, THE ECLIPSE itself, tearing the city into the sky.\n\n- **DUO online co-op.** Quick Join a fellow archer or bring a friend. Share slow-time bubbles and drag each other back up.\n\n- **Free to start.** Play the first three levels free. One unlock opens the full climb, the elites, THE ECLIPSE and DUO.\n\n- Synthwave soundtrack that rises with the fight. Plays offline.", "short_description": "A living black hole is eating the stars, and its swarm is pouring down on the last city still lit. You are the last Arrowkeeper. Skate the Bowl on pure momentum, leap into the sky and loose arrows that ricochet through the horde. Hurl black holes, stack absurd item builds and push back the Eclipse. Free to start, with the full climb, THE ECLIPSE and DUO co-op in one unlock."}]}, "developer_name": "Vasb\u00e1nyai J\u00e1nos", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://arrowfall.lol/privacy_policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://arrowfall.lol/tos", "publisher_name": "The Collective", "support_website_url": "https://arrowfall.lol/contact", "website_url": "https://arrowfall.lol/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "644354873106712"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_in